claim.claim-text:
receiving a finger touch signal through the touch unit (220);
determining a finger touch region (20) in the touch unit (220) according to the finger touch signal (106); and
determining a first region (30) in the display unit (230), wherein the first region (30) is overlapped with the finger touch region (20); and
receiving the fingerprint data through the sensing unit (240), wherein the sensing unit (240) has a sensing region (40) overlapped with the finger touch region (20);
wherein a density of a part of the plurality of touch pixels (222) in the finger touch region (20) is less than a density of a part of the plurality of sensing pixels (242) in the sensing region (40).

a substrate (250);
a display unit (230) disposed on the substrate (250) and comprising a plurality of display pixels (232);
a touch unit (220) disposed on the display unit (230) and comprising a plurality of touch pixels (222), wherein the touch unit (220) has a finger touch region (20); and
a sensing unit (240) comprising a plurality of sensing pixels (242) and having a sensing region (40) overlapped with the finger touch region (20), wherein the display unit (230) is disposed between the touch unit (220) and the sensing unit (240),
wherein a density of a part of the plurality of touch pixels (222) in the finger touch region (20) is less than a density of a part of the plurality of sensing pixels (242) in the sensing region (40).
